# Saral v0.3: heap, linked list, trie, graph extras, arithmetic, else, while.
took data

heap is new data "heap"
push data "low" to heap priority : 3
push data "urgent" to heap priority : 1
push data "normal" to heap priority : 2
first is pop data heap
show first

list is new data "linked"
append data "a" to list
append data "b" to list
append data "c" to list
remove data "b" from list
show list

trie is new data "trie"
insert data trie value : "cat"
insert data trie value : "car"
insert data trie value : "dog"
words is prefix data trie "ca"
show words

graph is new data "graph"
link data graph from "a" to "b"
link data graph from "a" to "c"
link data graph from "b" to "d"
link data graph from "c" to "d"
walked is walk data graph from "a"
show walked
cyclic is cycle data graph
show cyclic
order is topological data graph
show order

x is 2 + 3 * 4
show x
if x > 10
    show "big"
else
    show "small"
n is 3
while n > 0
    show n
    n is n - 1
